### Hints:


### Input Format

The input is a single line containing the integer n.

### Output Format

The output is a single line containing the string "Yes" or "No".

### Sample Input

```
10
```

### Sample Output

```
Yes
```

### Explanation

The input is a 10x10 matrix.

### Constraints

1 <= n <= 1000

### Score

100

